  translation {
    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n7:09 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n9:24 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n11:39 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n1:54 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n4:09 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n8:10 am from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n10:25 am from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n12:41 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n2:55 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n5:10 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station"
